  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Sector Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objectives are (a) to improve road services on two main national corridors and the provincial road network, (b) to rehabilitate roads damaged by Typhoon Ketsana, and (c) to establish and operationalize a contingency fund for quick disaster response in the road sector.</narrative>
  </description>
